[{"client_msg_id":"07983a5f-da8e-4b3d-ab12-69498bd92aa3","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"rsyncにgitignoreを渡して *無視* する話があるから、反転できそうだなーと思ってましたが、確かにgit側の機能できるならその方がいいですね。\n\u003chttps://qiita.com/ponko2/items/d63218b267671bcda5da\u003e","ts":"1631013210.057600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: rsyncで.gitignoreにあるファイルを無視してリモートにコピーする - Qiita","id":1,"title":"rsyncで.gitignoreにあるファイルを無視してリモートにコピーする - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/ponko2/items/d63218b267671bcda5da","text":"-C と --filter を使う。 rsync -C --filter=\":- .gitignore\" -acvz --delete /path/to/project/ \u003cmailto:user@example.com|user@example.com\u003e:/path/to/proj...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-dGV4dD9peGxpYj1yYi00LjAuMCZ3PTg0MCZoPTUwMCZ0eHQ2ND1RSEJ2Ym10dk1nJnR4dC1jb2xvcj0lMjMzMzMmdHh0LWZvbnQ9SGlyYWdpbm8lMjBTYW5zJTIwVzYmdHh0LXNpemU9NDUmdHh0LWFsaWduPXJpZ2h0JTJDYm90dG9tJnM9MDM1MGRjZDUxZTAyZDcwNjNiZTE3NzEwNDRhZDU2MDY\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=4c4d3846303e7cc32f76c9d16b3c0424","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/ponko2/items/d63218b267671bcda5da","original_url":"https://qiita.com/ponko2/items/d63218b267671bcda5da"}],"edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1631013271.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bQ4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d76fa4bf-769c-487f-b38e-77552aa34723","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`.gitignore` 見なくても、無視されているファイルの一覧とかは取れるはず。と言うか `.gitignore` はパターン(ワイルドカード)も書けるので現物ベースじゃないと判断できない","ts":"1631013140.056700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4mV4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23b0e52e-86a3-4328-8c5b-5a2d3b359aff","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u0026gt; node_modulesをcpすると爆発する\nこういうの思うとlnが無難か。 `.env`を編集した時の同期問題もありますし。","ts":"1631012871.055800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E80"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d70bebdf-0616-4e6d-af38-ba54bd4563a3","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"とりあえずignoreに入っているもの全部をコピー or lnするようにして、`--`以降の引数は `rsync`とかに渡すようにすれば、+αでフィルタ追加できるんじゃないかと思います。プロジェクトルートにある.gitignoreだけを対象にするか、サブディレクトリの.gitignoreも探しにいくかで面倒さが違うくらいかなと。幸い、 `git worktree`には `--`がないですね。","ts":"1631012822.055200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v99Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ec7780c-d877-4650-8fd3-1b8c4b6bf1db","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"機械的にやるのがむずそうなのはそうですねぇ。ignore されているファイルのうちどれを同じにしたいのかが機械的にはわからなそう","ts":"1631008137.053000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LepE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d02e8d00-4214-408d-9064-db138d9f1aa2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そうですね。\nただ、全ファイルをやるじゃないとあるツールで対応とかは難しいだろうなと","ts":"1631008105.052500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c=+B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"786d2283-e514-4fe2-a79b-6b52bc400e57","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそも worktree の時点でブランチは絶対に違う","ts":"1631008091.052200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qezy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7405247d-3bee-410c-abda-29e40d4d260e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"依存の部分はわざわざ同じにしなくてもいいと思います。 `.env` 的な個人用の設定ファイルが問題になりそう、という話かと","ts":"1631008063.051500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mtW8X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21614507-32f2-48d6-9b44-54f81439e8ae","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"開発のブランチが違っているgit worktreeだと、パッケージの依存とかも違うかもなと...","ts":"1631008001.050700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m6zdY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac9d4aae-5620-4c9e-a344-560d230a831c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"別ブランチにする場合とはどういう場合でしょう?","ts":"1631007642.050200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kKg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7acd8c3d-751d-4238-bdc2-a715d58a0028","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"別ブランチにしたりする場合はlnだと対応しきれないだろうし、これ、という1つには絞りにくそうなのがつらいな...","ts":"1631006857.049900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Asx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"671e78b8-7b90-4ef6-b8d3-14b623278f4f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"手動で 1 ファイルずつ ln していたな…今は worktree 使ってないのだけど、いい方法あるならたしかにちょっと気になる","ts":"1631006644.049300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dU8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46ee62a5-752b-4f42-9e91-caa0912b3e52","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"(すぐに解が出なさそうだったら今夜はタスクが溜まってきたので……たぶん明日の晩に挑戦してみます)","ts":"1631002072.048400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OF2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa0bb1f2-1d9b-48bf-96cb-374de5c09285","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"alias張って、worktree作ってから.gitignoreされてるものをrsyncするみたいな方法がありそう","ts":"1631001508.047400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SzpbE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26ab0e0d-dc99-4bbf-ad66-ca8b926ee2cf","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"node_modulesをcpすると爆発するからそこだけ吹っ飛ばしてから入れ直しました","ts":"1630998986.046500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C1RBN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db578eb9-5272-449c-a2ea-ae3cdea9ed1d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"gitはgit管理のファイルの管理だけなので、そこは毎回作るか、他にどうにかするか...ですかね","ts":"1630998939.045800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z6Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70923044-b36d-4632-8dbc-5cbce6e6e04f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"書いてるとおり設定とかいろいろやるの面倒になってしまって","ts":"1630998849.045100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zdM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75145da6-e22b-4259-9688-c802dfb136c4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今日丁度worktree案件っぽいやつをリポジトリごとcp -rしました","ts":"1630998830.044500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"banjaku","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jHK0K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1042e24-254b-43c6-9a5e-379f2d1b418b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"`ln` 張る？","ts":"1630998822.044300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bg7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43805f7a-f2af-4d8d-a1d3-f7fddb15b2bf","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"最近`git worktree` をよく使ってるんですが、gitの監視対象外だけど開発時には必要なファイル(.envなど)までは多分複製されないので毎度毎度コピーするんか?って思ったんですけど、いい対応方法知ってる方います?\n今開発してるリポジトリにはその手のファイルは無いので問題ないんですが今後絶対発生するだろうなって思ってます","ts":"1630998746.043200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8y0"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"\u003c@U022PB40WAF\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1630967228.040200","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_orig